 "answer_card": {
  "title": "ansible.windows removed domain modules",
  "answer_md": "- `win_domain` → **`microsoft.ad.domain`**\n- `win_domain_controller` → **`microsoft.ad.domain_controller`**\n- `win_domain_membership` → **`microsoft.ad.membership`**\n- `win_feature`: `feature_result.restart_needed` removed, use `reboot_required`\n- `win_updates`: `filtered_reason` removed, use `filtered_reasons`",
